sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Presenter
    participant S as Injection Script
    participant App as Order Processing Service
    participant CW as CloudWatch
    participant WH as Webhook Alert
    participant DA as DevOps Agent
    participant RB as Runbook

    P->>S: Run injection script
    S->>App: Inject fault
    App->>CW: Error logs + degraded metrics
    CW->>CW: Alarm threshold breached
    CW->>WH: Business-level alert
    WH->>DA: "Order processing service is failing"
    DA->>RB: Look up order-processing-service
    RB-->>DA: ECS Service, DynamoDB, Log Group
    DA->>CW: Query logs for errors
    DA->>CW: Query metrics for anomalies
    DA->>App: Examine deployments and config
    DA-->>P: Root cause + Resolution Steps
    P->>App: Apply fix
    App->>CW: Healthy metrics restored
    CW->>CW: Alarm resolves
